    fields:  # 2edf
      statement: "The JSON output of 'hypergumbo verify-claims --json' must be a top-level object containing at minimum schema_version, view, and the claim verdicts list — not a bare JSON array as currently emitted."  # 2edf
      root_cause: "Top-level type is list (array), not dict. No envelope means: no schema_version, no summary statistics, no way to add new metadata without breaking consumers. Worst envelope offender among the JSON-emitting subcommands."  # 2edf
